fontes in hieme sint calidi, in aestate frigidi.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>CAP. XLVIII.  <HI REND="ITALIC">De aqua calida vel putida.</HI></ITEM> <ITEM>CAP. XLIX.  <HI REND="ITALIC">De aqua veneno infecta, seu de mortiferis
